Package: MedNova
Title: Medical Research Workflow Planning and Script Generation
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Edison", "Liang", email = "maintainer@example.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides a medical research analysis platform for configuring
    task inputs, reviewing workflow recommendations, and generating runnable R
    scripts for a focused set of study scenarios. The package only generates
    code and does not run analyses automatically.
